[cdfk@otter.hpl.hp.com (Caroline Knight) writes:]
[] By the way is it unlucky to leave a pet behind, and what are the
[] differences between pets and tame animals - I've noticed that trying to
[] move where they are (in safe mode) gets different messages. 

you probably noticed the difference between "tame" and "peaceful".
use the "/" command to identify the different monsters.  peaceful
monsters will not bother you (normally) and tame monsters will work
on your behalf but need to be fed from time to time.  pets are tame.

you can "abandon" pets on another level with no ill luck effects.
{{{... Spoiler Alert ...}}}


